# The settings every recording shares, which mise run tapes (scripts/tapes.ts) puts ahead of each
# tape's own commands, so a change here, the theme's above all, is one line for all five.
# tapes/README.md gives each value's reason, and the unit tier holds these to it.
Set Shell bash
Set FontFamily "CaskaydiaMono Nerd Font"
Set FontSize 20
Set Width 1000
Set Height 640
Set Padding 20
Set Theme "zenwritten_dark"
Set TypingSpeed 30ms
Set Framerate 24
Set WaitTimeout 120s
